+// Switches (GXTexture.cpp, read once): WIICOMPILED_GX_G7=0 turns it off, WIICOMPILED_GX_G7_LOCK=0 keeps
+// only the test-and-set GX object lock, WIICOMPILED_GX_G7_CHECK=1 runs the full paths and compares.
